Route1_Text_WorkAtPokeMartTakeSample::
    .string "Hi!\n"
    .string "I work at a POKéMON MART.\p"
    .string "It's part of a convenient chain\n"
    .string "selling all sorts of items.\p"
    .string "Please, visit us in VIRIDIAN CITY.\p"
    .string "I know, I'll give you a sample.\n"
    .string "Here you go!$"

Route1_Text_ComeSeeUsIfYouNeedPokeBalls::
    .string "Please come see us if you need\n"
    .string "POKé BALLS for catching POKéMON.$"

Route1_Text_PutPotionAway::
    .string "{PLAYER} put the POTION away in\n"
    .string "the BAG's ITEMS POCKET.$"

Route1_Text_CanJumpFromLedges::
    .string "See those ledges along the road?\p"
    .string "It's a bit scary, but you can jump\n"
    .string "from them.\p"
    .string "You can get back to PALLET TOWN\n"
    .string "quicker that way.$"

Route1_Text_BenIntro::
    .string "This is ROUTE 1!\p"
    .string "PALLET's researchers pass through\n"
    .string "here all the time.\p"
    .string "I want a battle report too!$"

Route1_Text_BenRematchIntro::
    .string "I know ROUTE 1 better now.\n"
    .string "This time I won't freeze up!$"

Route1_Text_BenDefeat::
    .string "Whoa!\n"
    .string "Fieldwork can be tough!$"

Route1_Text_BenPostBattle::
    .string "The grass here is gentle, but it\n"
    .string "still teaches you to pay attention.$"

Route1_Text_JaniceIntro::
    .string "I like watching the aides from\n"
    .string "PALLET study the grass here.\p"
    .string "Let me see how your POKéMON\n"
    .string "moves through it!$"

Route1_Text_JaniceRematchIntro::
    .string "You've walked this road before.\n"
    .string "Let's see how far you've grown!$"

Route1_Text_JaniceDefeat::
    .string "You and your POKéMON move so well\n"
    .string "together!$"

Route1_Text_JanicePostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 1 feels different when you\n"
    .string "notice every patch of grass.$"

Route1_Text_MiloIntro::
    .string "I camp near PALLET because the\n"
    .string "outpost makes this road lively.\p"
    .string "Care for a field test?$"

Route1_Text_MiloRematchIntro::
    .string "Back through the outpost road?\n"
    .string "Good. Show me steadier steps!$"

Route1_Text_MiloDefeat::
    .string "You found the path through me!$"

Route1_Text_MiloPostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 1 is short, but it teaches\n"
    .string "the rhythm of roads, grass, and\l"
    .string "battles.$"

Route1_Text_LiamIntro::
    .string "I keep watch near these ledges.\p"
    .string "They're a quick way back, but a\n"
    .string "battle is the better lesson!$"

Route1_Text_LiamRematchIntro::
    .string "You know the ledges now.\n"
    .string "Do you know my team too?$"

Route1_Text_LiamDefeat::
    .string "I stepped right into that!$"

Route1_Text_LiamPostBattle::
    .string "A good route gives you choices:\n"
    .string "grass, road, or a ledge home.$"

Route1_Text_DianaIntro::
    .string "I packed a picnic for the walk\n"
    .string "between PALLET and VIRIDIAN.\p"
    .string "A battle makes the trip brighter!$"

Route1_Text_DianaRematchIntro::
    .string "I saved a spot on the grass.\n"
    .string "Let's make this walk memorable!$"

Route1_Text_DianaDefeat::
    .string "My picnic got scattered!$"

Route1_Text_DianaPostBattle::
    .string "A quiet road should feel kind.\n"
    .string "It gives you room to notice things.$"

Route1_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "ROUTE 1\n"
    .string "PALLET TOWN - VIRIDIAN CITY$"
